<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5524] When there are more than 2 parameters of concat function in cc column, SQL modeling fails.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5524</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When there are more than 2 parameters of concat function listed in cc in SQL, SQL modeling fails and an error of &lt;tt&gt;no match found for function signature&lt;/tt&gt; is reported.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#22312; SQL &#20013; cc &#21015;&#26377;concat&#20989;&#25968;&#21442;&#25968;&#22823;&#20110; 2 &#20010;&#30340;&#24773;&#20917;&#19979;&#65292;SQL &#24314;&#27169;&#22833;&#36133;&#65292;&#25253;{{no match found for function signature}}&#30340;&#38169;&#35823;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13533933">KYLIN-5524</key>
